  "description": "Hae-Mi is an ordinary high school art teacher. Sure, she gets scolded by the principal a lot, but her personality makes it impossible for anyone to hate her. While Hae-Mi has her eyes set on one of her fellow teachers, things start to get a little more complicated when her old childhood friend steps into the picture. Between the confusion and the drama, the three of them keep crossing paths in unexpected ways. \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS)\n\n*Note: Includes 2 extra chapters.*",
